1
00:00:00,934 --> 00:00:03,234
Wait. In The Hitchhikers Guide
to the Galaxy...

2
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:06,963
...isn't 43 the answer to the question of life,
the universe, and everything?

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,940
That's 42, dumb-ass.

4
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:11,940
(Raj:)Hey, hey.

5
00:00:12,112 --> 00:00:13,742
(Raj:)Feelings.

6
00:00:15,448 --> 00:00:17,478
(Howard:)We should stop. I'm exhausted.

7
00:00:17,651 --> 00:00:20,051
(Raj:)Yeah, me too.
We've got more important things to do.

8
00:00:20,253 --> 00:00:21,773
Who cares what stupid 43 means?

9
00:00:21,955 --> 00:00:23,855
- Not me.
- Let's go home.

10
00:00:26,626 --> 00:00:29,616
(Raj:)- Want to get something to eat?
- Sounds good.

11
00:00:31,798 --> 00:00:35,258
- What the balls is 43?
- I have to know.

12
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:41,730
(Howard:)Hi.

13
00:00:41,908 --> 00:00:44,038
(Penny:)Hey. Shouldn't you be out with your gang...

14
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,480
...spray-painting equations
on the side of buildings?

15
00:00:48,782 --> 00:00:51,652
- Come on, I'm sorry.
- I just can't believe you don't trust me.

16
00:00:51,818 --> 00:00:53,308
No, I do. Of course I do.

17
00:00:53,486 --> 00:00:57,646
(Penny:)Then why did you embarrass me in front of
my friend? Who knew exactly who you were.

18
00:00:57,824 --> 00:01:04,024
- Really?
- Your picture's on my refrigerator.

